# microfolio reads no environment variable of its own.
#
# The site's address — which decides the base path and every absolute URL in the
# sharing tags, the canonical links and the sitemap — is set once, in
# src/lib/config.js, under `url`.
#
# A custom domain on GitHub Pages is configured in the repository settings
# (Settings › Pages › Custom domain) and at your registrar. There is no CNAME
# file to write: published through an Actions workflow, GitHub ignores any CNAME
# in the build.
